===Etymology===
From {{inh|en|enm|seven}}, from {{inh|en|ang|seofon||seven}}, from {{inh|en|gmw-pro|*sebun||seven}}, from {{inh|en|gem-pro|*sebun||seven}}, from {{inh|en|ine-pro|*septḿ̥||seven}}.

Cognate with {{cog|sco|seiven||seven}}, {{cog|fy|sân||seven}}, {{cog|stq|soogen||seven}}, {{cog|nds|söven||seven}}, {{cog|nl|zeven||seven}}, {{cog|de|sieben||seven}}, {{cog|da|syv||seven}}, {{cog|no|sju||seven}}, {{cog|is|sjö||seven}}, {{cog|la|septem||seven}}, {{cog|grc|ἑπτά||seven}}, {{cog|ru|семь}}, {{cog|sa|सप्तन्|tr=saptán}}.

